      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This 3 bed end of terrace house is conveniently located in Fairgreen Village within walking distance of local schools and shops. The property is in turn key condition and ready for immediate occupation. \nThe Accommodation extends to c.90 sq. m and includes Entrance Hall, Kitchen/Dining, Living Room, Guest WC, Three Bedrooms, One En-suite and Family Bathroom.There is an enclosed rear garden with side pedestrian access. The property has the benefit of off street parking. \nGas fired central heating. Mains Services. \n\nEntrance Hall - 5.15m (16'11) x 2m (6'7)\nWood flooring\n\nLiving Room - 4.06m (13'4) x 3.03m (9'11)\nCarpet, Gas fire insert\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.05m (16'7) x 3.03m (9'11)\nTiled floor, Quality fitted kitchen, Electric hob and oven with extractor fan\n\nGuest WC\nTiled floor, WC, WHB\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.33m (10'11) x 3.35m (11'0)\nCarpet, Fitted wardrobe\n\nEn-suite - 2.04m (6'8) x 1m (3'3)\nFully tiled, Pump shower unit, WC, WHB\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m (11'10) x 2.7m (8'10)\nCarpet, Fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m (8'10) x 2.5m (8'2)\nCarpet, Fitted wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2m (6'7) x 2m (6'7)\nFully tiled, Bath, Electric shower over bath, WC, WHB\n\n\nwhat3words /// parity.cartoon.crated\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
